WEBVTT

1
00:00:10,510 --> 00:00:12,510
Let go first. Xizhu hasn't completely died yet.

2
00:00:12,510 --> 00:00:13,910
You just said you would never see her again

3
00:00:13,910 --> 00:00:15,910
You guys have seen her many times and she was so scared.

4
00:00:15,910 --> 00:00:18,230
Just say thank you for everything

5
00:00:18,230 --> 00:00:19,230
Without you today

6
00:00:19,230 --> 00:00:20,430
Something might really happen to Yun Xi

7
00:00:20,430 --> 00:00:21,830
When you see resources in the future, look around first

8
00:00:21,830 --> 00:00:23,230
Edible things attract people

9
00:00:23,230 --> 00:00:24,230
Also attracts animals

10
00:00:24,430 --> 00:00:26,230
This is not a farmhouse, remember

11
00:00:26,630 --> 00:00:27,830
later found flakes of food

12
00:00:27,830 --> 00:00:29,430
The first thing is not to rush in and dig.

13
00:00:29,430 --> 00:00:31,830
First look for footprints, feces, and signs of eating.

14
00:00:31,830 --> 00:00:34,630
Decide whether you can keep it or not. Today it’s a wild boar, next time it might be a bear.

15
00:00:34,630 --> 00:00:37,430
Then in the future we won’t dare to step on it, will we not step on it?

16
00:00:37,430 --> 00:00:38,830
Don't risk your life for those ten minutes

17
00:00:38,830 --> 00:00:40,230
Make sure it's safe before proceeding

18
00:00:40,630 --> 00:00:42,030
Replace these taro with some pork

19
00:00:42,030 --> 00:00:43,230
Taro for pork

20
00:00:43,230 --> 00:00:44,230
What you think is quite beautiful

21
00:00:44,230 --> 00:00:45,830
I have so many sweet potatoes that I can’t finish them all.

22
00:00:45,830 --> 00:00:47,430
Do you think I'm missing a few taros?

23
00:00:47,430 --> 00:00:49,030
At least he just saved our lives.

24
00:00:49,030 --> 00:00:50,030
No favors at all

25
00:00:50,030 --> 00:00:52,230
Just when I was with you, I didn’t open a trading platform.

26
00:00:52,230 --> 00:00:53,830
Don’t discount your life-saving kindness either.

27
00:00:53,830 --> 00:00:55,230
Mix the two things together

28
00:00:55,230 --> 00:00:57,630
In the end, everyone feels that they have suffered a loss.

29
00:00:57,630 --> 00:00:59,430
Then we'll talk about it later with what you need.

30
00:01:02,820 --> 00:01:04,620
This time I finally look like a person who can do business.
